# `wdcaltdigin` — the READ cell that `#494` left open when it closed the WRITE cell of the same `if`

VERDICT line first, then the liveness token `CODEX_ALTDIGIN_20260911`.

**Please do not simply ratify.** Twice today a codex pass has refuted the central premise of a brief
of mine, both times correctly — one claimed a probe row witnessed five sites it never touches, one
claimed two callers that do not exist. **Check the premises, not just the derivations.** "Your cell
table is wrong" is the most valuable answer you can give.

